-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, November to December has come in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, more than any other pair. In 2025, September to October ran 18% of normal and October to November 22% on the middle of the grids. This year so far, March to April 2026 came in at 27% and May to June 2026 at 166%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 13389 at 51%.</p>"}
